@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+# Local-only review candidate
+
+This is a modified build of Freerouting v2.4.1, official source commit
+`ae3d377740b6ffa744bed1bab26625fe0278fa90`. It is not the official release.
+
+Local modifications remove analytics transports and credential refresh,
+remove version-check networking, disable REST/MCP factories, force headless
+CLI execution, and prevent CLI/environment/config from enabling those features.
+All autorouter, board, geometry, core, rules, IO, DRC and management files remain
+byte-identical to the pinned official source.
+
+Freerouting and this source patch retain the upstream GPL-3.0 license in LICENSE.
+The full source copy is available beside the local candidate; the exact patch
+and build/audit evidence are in the badge workspace's
+`tools/portrait_environment/freerouting-offline/` directory.
+
+The router has not been executed against a user PCB as part of this build.
+Static source checks are not a runtime network-isolation guarantee. The new
+artifact must be reviewed before any execution; original default-telemetry
+commands are not authorized by this notice.
--- a/docs/architecture.md
+++ b/docs/architecture.md
@@ -452,3 +452,11 @@
 - Server and job execution usually starts in `api` and `management`.
 - File parsing and export usually starts in `io`.
 - When in doubt, follow the data model first, then the orchestration layer, then the UI.
+
+## Local-only review variant (2026-09-30)
+
+This copied source tree is patched for a local-only CLI candidate. The REST/MCP
+server factories return null, GUI and server modes cannot be enabled, all
+analytics sending backends are no-ops, and version checks are removed. The
+routing pipeline and board IO are unchanged. See `../LOCAL_ONLY_NOTICE.md`.
+This is not an upstream architecture change or an official release.
